<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Aries cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Aries cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African group Aries Packaging Ltd said on Monday that it is in talks that, if successfully concluded, could have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>The group advised shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in Aries shares until another announcement is made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
